1
00:00:48,119 --> 00:00:49,479
Zhang Tianyou.

2
00:00:49,479 --> 00:00:52,000
Now even Heaven is on my side.

3
00:00:52,119 --> 00:00:54,039
How can you possibly fight me?

4
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:15,680
Move!

5
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,719
Let me go!

6
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:19,799
Let go!

7
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,760
Jiushuang.

8
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,959
Miss Sheng.

9
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,760
You two,

10
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:30,120
would you rather die with Zhang Tianyou,

11
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:34,079
or live happily with me, Li Xiao?

12
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,799
Then I'd rather die!

13
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:41,920
Good.

14
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,040
How devoted.

15
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,079
Miss Sheng,

16
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,200
what about you?

17
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,000
Ling Yu.

18
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:01,959
At least you know what's good for you.

19
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:05,159
Don't worry, I won't mistreat you.

20
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:09,919
Smells so good.

21
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:16,759
Use explosives to cave this whole place in.

22
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:20,919
Even if this filthy dirt-digger survives the cave-in,

23
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,879
he'll still be like a rat,

24
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:24,759
digging his way out for the next decade.

25
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,680
Look.

26
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,879
Look at this pathetic, dejected face,

27
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,479
looking like his whole family just died.

28
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:41,560
Zhang Tianyou.

29
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,599
Look at you now.

30
00:02:43,599 --> 00:02:45,360
This feels great!

31
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:48,840
Let's go.

32
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:54,680
Zhang Tianyou!

33
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,879
Zhang Tianyou, pull yourself together!

34
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,879
The Zhang Tianyou I know wouldn't act like this.

35
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:04,439
Come with me.

36
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,800
Young Master Qi, that's enough.

37
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:17,120
Just leave him in one piece. Times are tough for everyone.

38
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,800
Cooled off? We're done here.

39
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,159
Let's go.

40
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:42,680
Let's go.

41
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:57,800
Young Master!

42
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,360
That bastard Li Xiao blew up the path!

43
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,840
Is this place gonna collapse?!

44
00:04:03,039 --> 00:04:04,199
Southeast corner, stick to the wall!

45
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:04,759
Go!

46
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,080
Go, go, go, go!

47
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:37,920
Rat Bro!

48
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,639
Are you still in one piece?

49
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:41,839
I'm fine.

50
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:42,920
Look,

51
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,240
Young Master, make yourself useful.

52
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,319
Light this torch.

53
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,800
I'll go scout ahead.

54
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,519
Zhang Tianyou, you...

55
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:10,720
do you think I suddenly snapped out of it?

56
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,959
I was just putting on an act for Li Xiao.

57
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,279
You have to let him get cocky before he goes crazy.

58
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,480
Hope I didn't scare you half to death.

59
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:23,319
I was just wondering...

60
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,600
how Ling Yu is doing.

61
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,279
Ling Yu?

62
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:28,040
When she left with Li Xiao earlier,

63
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,319
we exchanged a look.

64
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:32,319
I signaled her to look for a chance out there

65
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,800
to see if she could get us out.

66
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:40,079
What's wrong, Rat Bro?

67
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,040
It's no use.

68
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,319
It's completely blocked front and back.

69
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,680
We're just waiting to die.

70
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,040
Chun'er!

71
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:02,240
Chun'er!

72
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,160
Chun'er!

73
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,680
Stop shouting.

74
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:09,639
I gave her a double dose of Worry-Free Powder.

75
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:15,040
She's probably sleeping so deeply she forgot her name.

76
00:06:16,959 --> 00:06:19,240
Uncle Mei and Brother Wan are here.

77
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,319
Let's go.

78
00:06:20,319 --> 00:06:21,879
I'll take you to meet them.

79
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:25,279
Remember our script?

80
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,560
You only have one line.

81
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,920
Everything Brother Li Xiao said is true.

82
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,279
If you get it wrong,

83
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:46,079
next time it won't be just one person lying here.

84
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:04,199
Let's go.

85
00:07:09,639 --> 00:07:11,319
Brother Wan.

86
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:14,639
I brought Ling Yu back safely.

87
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:17,360
Thank heavens!

88
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,319
Where is my sister?

89
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,720
Is she still alive?

90
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,560
Chun'er!

91
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:24,720
It's all my fault for being useless.

92
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:27,279
I failed to protect Chun'er.

93
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:30,079
To save us in the secret chamber, Chun'er

94
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:33,800
was attacked by Zhang Tianyou's Two-Headed Venomous Snake

95
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,720
and got bitten.

96
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:38,240
She was infected with a strange poison

97
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:40,439
and is still unconscious.

98
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,360
And Jiushuang...

99
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:44,680
Jiushuang!

100
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:49,319
That bastard pushed her into the Pit of Ten Thousand Snakes.

101
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:53,639
Not even her bones remain.

102
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:56,800
Two-headed snakes? The Pit of Ten Thousand Snakes?

103
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,439
Li Xiao,

104
00:07:58,439 --> 00:08:00,360
where exactly did you go?

105
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,879
It was terrifying!

106
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:09,279
The structure inside was extremely complex,

107
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,759
with a diverse ecosystem.

108
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,720
My brothers and I fought a bloody battle

109
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,519
just to make it out alive.

110
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:18,120
If I, Li Xiao, am lying at all,

111
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,519
may lightning strike me down!

112
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,360
Ling Yu,

113
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:25,560
tell Brother Wan if that's true.

114
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,360
That's right.

115
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:34,080
Everything Brother Li Xiao said is true.

116
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,399
Well, over there,

117
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:37,440
there were indeed a lot of small animals.

118
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,919
Where is the item?

119
00:08:48,639 --> 00:08:50,600
Don't tell me it was also bitten by some two-headed snake.

120
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,399
The item is here.

121
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,519
Go get it.

122
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:54,399
The item is fine.

123
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:57,879
Brother Wan, it's completely intact.

124
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,799
Although it was a narrow escape,

125
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:02,559
but fortunately, I didn't let anyone down.

126
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:10,039
Since you're so capable,

127
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:11,919
when the head of the Mei family returns,

128
00:09:11,919 --> 00:09:15,480
I'll propose you become the Acting Leader.

129
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:17,240
Me?

130
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,960
How could I possibly accept that?

131
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:22,639
I will serve until my dying breath!

132
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:23,639
Don't be in such a hurry to die.

133
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,279
Finding the Zhang family descendant is what matters now.

134
00:09:26,279 --> 00:09:28,080
Do you have a lead on this?

135
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,240
Don't worry, Brother Wan.

136
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,320
I've got it all in the palm of my hand.

137
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,360
They won't get away.

138
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:42,720
Go.

139
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,799
Find someone immediately.

140
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:44,559
Yes.

141
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,799
Li Xiao.

142
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:49,960
What exactly happened?

143
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,200
Uncle Mei,

144
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:55,000
I'm so sorry!

145
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,600
I was useless.

146
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:59,519
I couldn't bring Jiushuang out.

147
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:04,000
It's all my fault!

148
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:08,679
Here.

149
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:09,840
Press on this.

150
00:10:11,679 --> 00:10:12,480
Young Master,

151
00:10:12,919 --> 00:10:15,720
if you have any secret tricks up your sleeve,

152
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,720
just use them!

153
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:17,559
Don't hide them anymore.

154
00:10:17,559 --> 00:10:18,799
I don't want to die here.

155
00:10:18,799 --> 00:10:20,720
Look at what I'm wearing!

156
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:24,399
The magnetic field here is chaotic,

157
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,960
yin energy is leaking,

158
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,240
and yin and yang are unbalanced.

159
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,120
If my deduction is correct,

160
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:33,279
the next Geomantic Tide is in four days max.

161
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,039
The chamber's structure will be at its weakest.

162
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:39,440
If we manage to survive until then,

163
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:42,080
we might still have a fighting chance.

164
00:10:43,039 --> 00:10:46,159
Actually, there's another way.

165
00:10:46,159 --> 00:10:49,519
I just hope we won't have to use it.

166
00:10:51,879 --> 00:10:52,759
Zhang Tianyou,

167
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,519
can you tell me now?

168
00:11:09,879 --> 00:11:10,960
Alright.

169
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:13,600
Back then...

170
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,399
when exploring the Tidal Tomb together,

171
00:11:15,639 --> 00:11:17,039
Wan, Mei, Qi, and Sheng

172
00:11:17,039 --> 00:11:19,360
were merely servants of the Zhang Family.

173
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:22,519
But I don't know

174
00:11:22,519 --> 00:11:25,080
what exactly happened in that Tidal Tomb.

175
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,399
After coming out,

176
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:30,039
each had the Zhang Family's Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye.

177
00:11:30,799 --> 00:11:31,879
They suddenly transformed

178
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:33,480
into today's Four Great Families.

179
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:37,840
Thus provoking the tomb's evil entities,

180
00:11:37,919 --> 00:11:41,120
resulting in 20 years of constant disasters.

181
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:46,399
So you sought to gather the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye

182
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:48,240
to become the leader of the four families,

183
00:11:48,799 --> 00:11:50,559
just to uncover the truth of what happened back then.

184
00:11:51,519 --> 00:11:53,720
Only by returning to where it all began

185
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:57,639
can we learn what happened in the Tidal Tomb

186
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:00,519
and what the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family experienced 20 years ago.

187
00:12:01,919 --> 00:12:04,200
And also take back everything belonging to the Zhang Family.

188
00:12:05,159 --> 00:12:06,279
I also want to know,

189
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:08,120
within The Four Great Families,

190
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,639
what the root cause of the bizarre deaths really is.

191
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,120
So it really is you,

192
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,320
Zhang Tianyou.

193
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,480
What's that sound?

194
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,759
Someone's here.

195
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:26,080
It's not human.

196
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,440
It's an anomaly.
